          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193619_307763_26363"/>
          <body> the object to which the Document is assigned. &lt;example&gt; A document assigned to ActivityAssignment may provide further description of the input or output of that activity.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
