        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193075_486168_23523"/>
        <body>A Document is a logical document that serves as the identifier for a container for some product data. &lt;note&gt; The following additional data can be assigned to a Document: ActivityMethod, Approval, Certification, Contract, DateTimeString, Document, DocumentVersion, DocumentDefinition, File, Effectivity, InformationUsageRight, Project, RequirementView, SecurityClassification, and WorkRequest.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
