        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193073_48115_23517"/>
        <body>A DigitalDocumentDefinition is a type of DocumentDefinition that collects files that are archived on an optical computer disc, magnetic, electronic storage, or a combination thereof. A DigitalDocumentDefinition may consist of one or many component DigitalFile.</body>
      </ownedComment>
