    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193058_322752_23487" xmi:uuid="4760f0c6-b12a-4c24-b453-24bd9bf60b0d" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454510592847_943774_43453" xmi:uuid="0ca9b561-57a7-4ff6-b94f-606561eebb95" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193058_322752_23487"/>
        <body>A CreationProperty is a specification of characteristics of File or of DocumentDefinition objects. It specifies the context of the creation of the object. At least one of the optional attributes shall be specified for each instance of this object. In the case where a CreationProperty is referred by a DocumentDefinition the characteristics apply to all individual File objects, whereas in the case it is referred by a File, the characteristics apply on an individual basis.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_290014c_1528731326405_63883_102931" xmi:uuid="e692566e-713d-409f-83fe-0bdd1aa48217" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement href="../../../../SysML_ARM/SYSML_ARM_AP242.xmi#_2_attr_SYSML_ARM-Assigned_document_property-described_element"/>
        <annotatedElement href="../../../../SysML_ARM/SYSML_ARM_AP242.xmi#_2_attr_SYSML_ARM-Classification_assignment-items"/>
        <body>Entities like Description_text_assignment, Classification_assignment, Identification_assignment, etc. have their items property unmapped in the mapping specification since they have to be completed where used.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>CreationProperty</name>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193553_862203_25927" xmi:uuid="257fe537-0174-4b45-8b60-14783d704462" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454510622205_159187_43454" xmi:uuid="e5fca5f2-a9a0-4503-9a1c-25161f5fa21a" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193553_862203_25927"/>
          <body> the text or the set of texts that provide further information about the CreationProperty. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Description</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193068_300298_23514"/>
        <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194370_562774_31170" xmi:uuid="43accb7d-3f73-4f1e-9d2a-b4110f343a0c" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
        <aggregation>composite</aggregation>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193553_754363_25926"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193553_54934_25928" xmi:uuid="28ceaeb3-8605-459d-9dd5-075f48edc77b" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454510652465_821389_43455" xmi:uuid="560018f1-3ff4-48f0-8989-d40d8140be62" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193553_54934_25928"/>
          <body> the computer application used to create the File or DocumentDefinition object. &lt;example&gt;'Postscript Printer Driver' is an example for a creating interface of a PhysicalDocumentDefinition. &lt;/example&gt;The value of this attribute need not be specified. </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>CreatingInterface</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193305_210532_23945"/>
