        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193080_188871_23529"/>
        <body>A DocumentVersion is a release of a Document. &lt;note&gt; The following additional data can be assigned to a DocumentVersion: ActivityMethod, Approval, Certification, Contract, DateTimeString, Document, DocumentVersion, DocumentDefinition, File, Effectivity, InformationUsageRight, Project, RequirementView, SecurityClassification, and WorkRequest.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
