        <annotatedElement href="../../../../SysML_ARM/SYSML_ARM_AP242.xmi#_2_attr_SYSML_ARM-Document_version-of_product"/>
        <body>Document.Versions provides the mapping of Document_version.of_product </body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1551098333098_702761_139525" xmi:uuid="b1ce7c09-a4c4-4f8e-89d3-cab238c41f74" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_290014c_1550847743191_208266_98071"/>
        <body>These flowports are not bound to the ARM target because only a product definition property type can be assigned to it.</body>
      </ownedComment>
