          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193630_556605_26503"/>
          <body> the identifier or set of identifiers for the DocumentRelationship. &lt;note&gt; This attribute supports multi-identification in different contexts as described in Fundamental concepts and assumptions.&lt;/note&gt; The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
