    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193106_349152_23582" xmi:uuid="b8d1d6b5-bdde-4365-b218-b7a1e1abdd23" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454512040709_862296_43512" xmi:uuid="3ecc3b8f-f59a-424d-9fac-f2ab99cab10d" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193106_349152_23582"/>
        <body>A FormatProperty is a specification of characteristics of a File or of a DocumentDefinition that specify the format of the object. At least one of the optional attributes shall be specified for each instance of this object. In the case where a FormatProperty is referred by a DocumentDefinition the characteristics apply to all individual File objects, whereas in the case it is referred by a File the characteristics apply on an individual basis.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>FormatProperty</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193698_52358_26986" xmi:uuid="cbe7ff38-4d88-4d8a-a839-f685a48e55f5" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general href="../ManagementResources/ManagementResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193259_964911_23867"/>
      </generalization>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193699_532429_26988" xmi:uuid="e03e88c9-e91c-4e4a-8111-d4b36be84356" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454512066497_751188_43513" xmi:uuid="e9c6e018-43e8-4ba6-973a-676cc262ab56" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193699_532429_26988"/>
          <body> the identifier or set of identifiers for the FormatProperty. The value of this attribute need not be specified. &lt;note&gt; This attribute supports multi-identification in different contexts as described in Fundamental concepts and assumptions.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Id</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193119_518292_23608"/>
        <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194499_623639_32193" xmi:uuid="968e7b33-0cbb-4316-a7fa-0898daf96d78" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
        <aggregation>composite</aggregation>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193699_469075_26987"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193699_12609_26989" xmi:uuid="38255f80-46da-4965-aa1f-e16666f0d7d9" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454512082952_979916_43514" xmi:uuid="67d42d92-f016-41bd-8c57-e916da7e268f" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193699_12609_26989"/>
          <body> the text or the set of texts that provide further information about the FormatProperty. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Description</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193068_300298_23514"/>
        <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194499_636972_32196" xmi:uuid="14f7e3f9-5e7e-4925-b023-c95bfd82f29c" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
        <aggregation>composite</aggregation>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193594_77208_26202"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193699_648881_26990" xmi:uuid="4cdff547-ba67-4f0e-a20e-44ba12037396" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454512139779_348263_43515" xmi:uuid="63a37d0e-ccb3-4ad3-b771-d7f852c82cf5" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193699_648881_26990"/>
          <body> the character code that is used in the characterized object. Where applicable, the following values shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'binary': The document contains data in binary format; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'IEC 61286': The coded character set used to encode the document data according to IEC 61286; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'ISO 646': The coded character set used to encode the document data according to ISO/IEC 646; &lt;note&gt; The character set in ISO/IEC 646 is identical to the character set commonly known as ASCII &lt;/note&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'ISO 6937': The coded character set used to encode the document data is according to ISO/IEC 6937; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'ISO 8859-1': The coded character set used to encode the document data according to ISO/IEC 8859-1; &lt;note&gt; The character set in ISO/IEC 8859-1 is identical to the character set commonly known as LATIN-1. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'ISO 10646': The coded character set used to encode the document data according to ISO/IEC 10646. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;The value of this attribute need not be specified. </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>CharacterCode</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193042_855579_23449"/>
        <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194499_517830_32199" xmi:uuid="e3d68e94-dae7-448e-becd-fb3917c55618" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193495_89931_25451"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193699_588395_26991" xmi:uuid="40f5af5f-cd3e-4efa-8457-04e2c90f57ed" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454512265768_645167_43516" xmi:uuid="5dd7119f-0fdb-4e40-a379-b1e4014aa9bf" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193699_588395_26991"/>
          <body> the convention that was used to structure the information in the characterized object. Where applicable, the following values shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'DXF': The document contains data in Drawing Exchange File format; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'IGES': The document contains data in Initial Graphics Exchange Specification format; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'ISO 10303-203': The document contains data in ISO 10303-203 format; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'ISO 10303-214': The document contains data in ISO 10303-214 format; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'ISO 10303-242': The document contains data in ISO 10303-242 format; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'TIFF CCITT GR4': The document contains data in TIFF CCITT GR4 format; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'VDAFS': The document contains data in VDAFS format; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'VOXEL': The document contains data in VOXEL format. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>DataFormat</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193042_855579_23449"/>
        <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194499_608100_32202" xmi:uuid="89ba1ecd-4361-4232-a021-df82c5a4128c" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193503_894628_25496"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193700_499383_26992" xmi:uuid="109ba587-0122-4a6a-8b24-3d85ec9d7494" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454512307737_826231_43517" xmi:uuid="75a8aacd-1397-45db-a609-fde9cebaf159" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193700_499383_26992"/>
          <body> the dimensions of a physical presentation of the object the sizeFormat is provided for. &lt;example&gt; 'ISO A0' is an example for the sizeFormat of a drawing that is stored digitally. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;example&gt; '0.2 x 0.4 x 0.4 meters' is an example for the sizeFormat of a wooden model. &lt;/example&gt;The value of this attribute need not be specified. </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>SizeFormat</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193219_856125_23803"/>
        <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194499_261283_32205" xmi:uuid="c44c9c3a-e4aa-45da-ae02-5c29a6b37884" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
        <aggregation>composite</aggregation>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193698_550334_26985"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1516873626912_879608_306183" xmi:uuid="b3b0ec32-c518-4734-8efc-4a9803e2370d" xmi:type="uml:Property">
