    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193079_200378_23527" xmi:uuid="da802bcd-ca18-4afa-a18d-9f99a0f075d8" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1551098075699_977064_139108" xmi:uuid="2a5e8c16-0cc8-447e-a329-d1e167420078" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_290014c_1550847743191_208266_98071"/>
        <body>These flowports are not bound to the ARM target because only a product definition property type can be assigned to it.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454511105583_64999_43473" xmi:uuid="b8c15dfa-cf10-451a-8d23-143be9456a7d" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193079_200378_23527"/>
        <body>A DocumentDefinitionRelationship is a relationship between two DocumentDefinition objects. &lt;note&gt; The following additional data can be assigned to a DocumentDefinitionRelationship: ActivityMethod, Approval, Certification, Condition, DateTimeString, Document, DocumentVersion, DocumentDefinition, File, Effectivity, InformationUsageRight, PropertyValue, ExternalPropertyDefinition, PropertyDefinition, and WorkRequest.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>DocumentDefinitionRelationship</name>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459327408276_679107_42544" xmi:uuid="e2f1836c-16b6-410c-ad98-81c56c79191f" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459327440669_315046_42546" xmi:uuid="16df538a-3062-43c3-bcf4-ae5a30f188be" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459327408276_679107_42544"/>
          <body>the related DocumentDefinition and the relating DocumentDefinition shall be different.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1671209121783_714674_163144" xmi:uuid="780f66bf-c5ad-40ed-a48d-a806fd31535d" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1671209121783_82723_163145" xmi:uuid="decbece8-e42e-49b9-8d31-9f9d66a28264" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body> &lt;sch:rule context="//DocumentDefinitionRelationship[@uid]"&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:let name="entity_name" value="if(@xsi:type) then substring-after(@xsi:type,':') else name()"/&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:let name="uidRelating" value="../@uid"/&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:let name="uidRelated" value="Related/@uidRef"/&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:assert test="not(../@uid = Related/@uidRef)"&gt;&#13; The related DocumentDefinition and the relating DocumentDefinition shall be different. &#13; {&#13; -entity_name:&lt;sch:value-of select="$entity_name"/&gt;&#13; -entity_uid:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt; &#13; -rule_name:DocumentDefinitionRelationship.WR1&#13; -relating:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uidRelating"/&gt;&#13; -related:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uidRelated"/&gt;&#13; }&#13; &lt;/sch:assert&gt;&#13; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1671209121784_455898_163146" xmi:uuid="f562cab0-0272-48af-ae79-ddea414cc9fb" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1671209121784_908018_163147" xmi:uuid="e6005e61-061c-4efa-afef-ad570be2165d" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>WR1: Relating :&lt;&gt;: Related;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>EXPRESS</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR1</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193079_200378_23527"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1509113412684_506509_31115" xmi:uuid="eb1161d1-0587-40e8-b7b1-e0320e15e1fa" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>self.Relating &lt;&gt; self.Related</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
