        </ownedComment>
        <name>ClassifiedAs</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193038_880755_23447"/>
        <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194441_174659_31673" xmi:uuid="f2e016e3-3473-4dcf-8017-695d7777ccf4" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
        <upperValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194441_845866_31672" xmi:uuid="1ba57b4d-ebbc-4965-b039-318bc76e384a" xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
          <value>*</value>
        </upperValue>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193476_459239_25336"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193629_352763_26496" xmi:uuid="9a6045b1-1f25-4f09-9ad9-78c97c07999a" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454511209309_972366_43477" xmi:uuid="a7ead6a5-5723-4e24-8f65-984b72a1a862" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193629_352763_26496"/>
          <body> the meaning of the relationship. Where applicable, the following class names shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'addition': The business object specifies that the Related document provides supplementary or collateral information with regard to the information provided by the Relating document; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'copy': The business object defines a relationship where the Related DocumentDefinition is a copy of the Relating DocumentDefinition; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'decomposition': The business object defines a relationship where the Related DocumentDefinition is one of potentially more sub documents of the Relating DocumentDefinition; &lt;example&gt; The decomposition of a document into clauses is an example for the use of this value. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'derivation': The business object defines a relationship where the Related DocumentDefinition is derived from the Relating DocumentDefinition; &lt;example&gt; A raster image may be derived from a three-dimensional CAD model. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;example&gt; A html version may be derived from a text document as an alternative. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'peer': The business object specifies that the Related document provides required information with regard to that provided by the Relating document. The peer document is essential for a complete understanding; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'reference': The business object defines a relationship where the Related document is referenced from the Relating; &lt;example&gt; A hyperlink is an example for a 'reference'. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'sequence': The business object defines a logical sequence where the Related DocumentDefinition comes after the Relating DocumentDefinition; &lt;example&gt; A sequence of clauses. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;''substitution': The business object defines a relationship where the Related DocumentDefinition replaces the Relating DocumentDefinition; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'translation': The DocumentDefinitionRelationship specifies that the Related document is generated through a translation process from the Relating document.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>RelationType</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193042_855579_23449"/>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193503_453626_25492"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193629_701124_26497" xmi:uuid="fba5a980-94ab-4664-87cf-d68cd1645667" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454511408045_146099_43478" xmi:uuid="90e2c3c6-4bc1-4db2-a5a3-a40335ba12e4" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193629_701124_26497"/>
          <body> one object of DocumentDefinition that is part of the relationship. &lt;note&gt; The semantics of this attribute are defined by the attribute RelationType.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Relating</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193078_811987_23526"/>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193624_146574_26462"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
