          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193630_652206_26498"/>
          <body> the other object of DocumentDefinition that is part of the relationship. &lt;note&gt; The semantics of this attribute are defined by the attribute RelationType.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
